OL,3,CSir Paul McCartney shortlisted for
OL,4,CMercury Prize for first time
OL,6,FSir Paul McCartney has been nominated
OL,7,Ffor a Mercury Prize for the first time.
OL,9,FThe 84-year-old is being recognised
OL,10,Ffor his recent album 'The Boys of
OL,11,FDungeon Lane', named after a place
OL,12,Fclose to his childhood home in
OL,13,FForthlin Road in Speke, Liverpool.
OL,15,FThe 14-track record is The Beatles'
OL,16,Fstar's 20th solo studio album and
OL,17,Freached number one on the UK album
OL,18,Fcharts.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
