OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785437306
OL,3,CSir Paul McCartney shortlisted for
OL,4,CMercury Prize for first time
OL,6,FHe is one of 12 artists to have made
OL,7,Fthis year's shortlist for the music
OL,8,Fprize alongside Raye and Florence and
OL,9,Fthe Machine.
OL,11,FAlbums are nominated based on musical
OL,12,Fmerit, irrespective of how successful
OL,13,Fthe record or act have been in the
OL,14,Fyear.
OL,16,FThe Beatles star's album recounts
OL,17,Fmemories from his formative years.
OL,18,FReleased at the end of May, it was Sir
OL,19,FPaul's first album in five years.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
