OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785437306
OL,3,CSir Paul McCartney shortlisted for
OL,4,CMercury Prize for first time
OL,6,FAlso on the shortlist are Raye's 'This
OL,7,FMusic May Contain Hope', Dave's 'The
OL,8,FBoy Who Played The Harp', Florence And
OL,9,FThe Machine's 'Everybody Scream', Dove
OL,10,FEllis's 'Blizzard' and Knats' 'A Great
OL,11,FDay In Newcastle'.
OL,13,FThe event will feature live
OL,14,Fperformances from many of the
OL,15,Fnominated artists before the winner is
OL,16,Fannounced.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
