PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785437306
OL,3,CSir Paul McCartney shortlisted for
OL,4,CMercury Prize for first time
OL,6,FThe Mercury Prize ceremony will be
OL,7,Fheld on Thursday 22 October at the
OL,8,FUtilita Arena Newcastle. The event was
OL,9,Falso held in Newcastle in 2025, its
OL,10,Ffirst year outside London.
OL,12,FSam Fender won last year's prize for
OL,13,Fhis album People Watching. Other
OL,14,Fwinners in recent years include
OL,15,FEnglish Teacher, Little Simz, Arlo
OL,16,FParks and Wolf Alice.
OL,18,FAlong with a trophy, the winner of the
OL,19,FMercury Prize receives #25,000.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
